{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>台慶劇《璀璨之城》中，張智霖弒父一幕清唱《Que Será, Será》嚇壞觀眾，但原來這首歌並非普通版本！劇 …</p><p></p>\n<p>台慶劇《璀璨之城》中，張智霖弒父一幕清唱《Que Será, Será》嚇壞觀眾，但原來這首歌並非普通版本！劇組專誠為其角色度身訂造「極暗黑版」，歌詞與編曲充滿詭異巧思，究竟這首心寒之歌隱藏了官孝賢甚麼不為人知的內心世界？不少網民直呼聽到起晒雞皮，成功為劇情增添恐怖氣氛。\n</p>\n<h2>張智霖「乾涸心寒版」清唱響起 劇組緊接播「極暗黑版本」</h2>\n<p>在昨晚（26日）播出的弒父重頭戲中，音樂的運用可謂功不可沒。當張智霖飾演的孝賢慢條斯理地準備送父親上路時，他以極度陰沉的哽咽式氣聲，現場清唱出「乾涸心寒版」的《Que Será, Será》，這個處理大大增加了畫面的心寒度。而為了將張力推至頂點，當他清唱完畢後，劇集隨即緊接播放時長約1分半鐘、由他親自演繹的「極暗黑版本」插曲，詭異的編曲配上空洞的環境聲，令心寒指數暴升至頂點。</p>\n<h2>揭《Que Será, Será》度身訂造內幕 詭異編曲配心寒演繹</h2>\n<p>為了讓劇情及角色更立體，劇組專誠為《璀璨之城》的插曲《Que Será, Será》重新改編，歌詞更是為官孝賢這個角色度身訂造，配以詭異的編曲及張智霖心寒的聲音演繹，極度有Feel。整個音樂設計旨在配合該場戲的陰森感與張力，從張智霖的現場清唱，到後期製作的「極暗黑版本」緊接播放，層層遞進，完美地透過音樂深化了角色的瘋狂與悲情，難怪不少網民表示聽到毛骨悚然。\n</p>\n<h2>《璀璨》版《Que Será, Será》改編歌詞全公開</h2>\n<p>劇組為孝賢度身訂造的《璀璨》版《Que Será, Será 》改編歌詞如下：</p>\n<p>When I was just a little boy I asked my father, “What will I be?”<br/>\n“Will I be handsome? Will I be rich?”<br/>\nHere’s what he said to me<br/>\n“Que Será, Será Whatever will be, will be”<br/>\n“The future’s not ours to see. ＂<br>\n“Que Será, Será What will be, will be”\n</br></p>\n<p>When I grew up and fell in love, I ask my sweetheart What lies ahead<br/>\nWill we have rainbows day after day?<br/>\nHere’s what sweetheart said<br/>\n“Que Será, Será Whatever will be, will be”<br/>\n“The future’s not ours to see.”<br/>\n“Que Será, Será What will be, will be”</p>\n<p>“Que Será, Será What will be, will be”\n</p>\n<h2>網民直呼聽到起雞皮：呢首歌以後有陰影！</h2>\n<p>這首度身訂造的「極暗黑版」《Que Será, Será》成功引起網民熱議，不少人直呼聽到起晒雞皮，認為歌曲的運用是神來之筆。網民留言：「原本係首好普通嘅歌，而家完全唔同晒，好心寒！」、「歌詞配埋個畫面，真係絕！完全感受到孝賢嘅絕望。」、「Chilam把聲好恐怖，但又好好聽，好矛盾！」、「以後喺街聽到《Que Será, Será》都會諗起呢一幕，有陰影喇！」、「神級配樂！將成場戲昇華到另一個層次。」</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/34_6385863016ae0398e7f631.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 張智霖 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/34_6385863016ae0398e7f631.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/35_19010242956ae0399234e49.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 張智霖 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/35_19010242956ae0399234e49.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/36_2725493566ae03995890c6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 張智霖 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/36_2725493566ae03995890c6.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/37_16967063046ae03998d1bfd.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 張智霖 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/37_16967063046ae03998d1bfd.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/38_8954375576ae0399b4788b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 張智霖 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/38_8954375576ae0399b4788b.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/39_9773870476ae0399dc9c71.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 張智霖 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/39_9773870476ae0399dc9c71.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/queserasera/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">QueSeraSera</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/tvb%e5%8d%b3%e6%99%82%e8%b3%87%e8%a8%8a/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">tvb即時資訊</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%bc%b5%e6%99%ba%e9%9c%96/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張智霖</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%92%80%e7%92%a8%e4%b9%8b%e5%9f%8e/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">璀璨之城</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：TVB資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3530983\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nOct 27 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T08:01:36.730355+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1852,"images":6,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T06:43:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T07:58:41.934224+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T07:58:41.934224+00:00","content_hash":"dcfdf97a2b0f87942acc21af41fa247175de81149b2d8edd3dd4010ed668b94c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}